flowchart LR
  U[User command] --> P[Trajectory planner]
  P -->|Cartesian waypoints| IK[Bounded numerical IK]
  P -->|MOVE J| C[Joint PID controller]
  IK --> C
  C --> D[Virtual inertia + damping drive]
  D --> Q[Joint positions]
  Q --> FK[Forward kinematics]
  Q --> E[Virtual encoders]
  E --> C
  FK --> V[CAD mesh / TCP visualization]
  P --> G[Gripper opening + task state]
  G --> V
  CFG[Authoritative SI configuration] -.-> P
  CFG -.-> IK
  CFG -.-> D
  CFG -.-> V
